    "title": "Emmy Noether: Modern LaTeX Working Corpus and Multilingual Translation Drafts (R816 / Integrated v19 Source-Control Update)",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.21306772",
    "publication_date": "2026-07-11",
    "description": "<p>This is the reader-facing Emmy Noether working record for the Modern LaTeX Editions of Mathematics Manuscripts project. This version fronts <code>00_Noether_German_Cumulative_Working_SourceControl_R816_v19_20260711.pdf</code>, a 466-page German source-control reader, and supplies the integrated R814-R816/LocalCodex v19 TeX, audit ledgers, source witnesses, diffs, render checks, previous-base references, and build logs in <code>07_Noether_Current_SourceControl_Integrated_v19_R814_R816_20260711.zip</code>.</p><p><strong>What changed:</strong> v19 retains the v18 source repairs in Papers 19, 31, 32, and 34 and independently checks Paper 34 printed pp. 641-649 and 663-668 against full-resolution GDZ witnesses. Together with v18's pp. 650-662 pass, the current German head now has a continuous independent Paper 34 audit through printed p. 668. The principal new mathematical correction is on printed p. 648: all three displayed conclusions of the first and second isomorphism theorems are restored from homomorphism signs to the source's isomorphism signs. Source-significant definition and scope emphasis is also restored on pp. 643-644 and 646-649. The v19 ZIP contains the current TeX/PDF/TXT, fifteen full source pages, focused relation-glyph crops, before/after renders, exact diffs, page dispositions, cumulative ledgers, and build logs.</p><p><strong>Status caveat:</strong> this is a serious source-repair and translation working corpus, not OCR-only, but it is not a critical edition, whole-corpus source-faithfulness certification, paper-by-paper certification, multilingual synchronization, or publication-grade proofreading. The retained English and multilingual readers predate some German source-control repairs and remain unsynchronized working translations. Filenames containing <code>COMPLETE</code> are inherited local-task labels only.</p><p><strong>GitHub:</strong> corrections, source comparisons, LaTeX fixes, and translation improvements can be suggested via issues or pull requests at <a href=\"https://github.com/KokunoYumeto/modern-latex-manuscripts\">https://github.com/KokunoYumeto/modern-latex-manuscripts</a>.</p>",
